### SkillForge AI - sample API requests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register a STUDENT (role defaults to STUDENT if omitted)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Asha Rao",
  "email": "asha.rao@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123",
  "role": "STUDENT"
}

### 2. Register a RECRUITER
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Neel Kapoor",
  "email": "neel.kapoor@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123",
  "role": "RECRUITER"
}

### 3. Attempt to self-register as ADMIN (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Someone",
  "email": "someone@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 4. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "asha.rao@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}

### 5. Get profile (paste the token from register/login above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### 6. Profile without a token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
